Files covered:

- data/ (all files): derived tables of the released build and its retrieval manifest
- guides/*.csv: coded voluntary siting guides and disclosure inventory
- sites/*.csv: curated inputs of the data center site register
- fetch/tepco_history_snapshots.csv: index of the archived TEPCO capacity lists used

The tables in data/capacity/ and data/history/ are structured extractions of figures published by
the operators; the other tables in data/ are computed from the published files. The source files
themselves (published by the ten Japanese general transmission and distribution operators, the
Ministry of the Environment and other publishers listed in README.md, "Sources and third-party
terms") are not redistributed here and remain subject to their publishers' own terms of use.
Attribution of the data should cite this dataset and name the publishing operators as the
original sources.

Not covered: tests/fixtures/ holds short excerpts of published source files used only by the
tests. They are not licensed under CC BY 4.0 (or under the MIT license of the code); rights remain
with the respective publishers.
